SUMMARY:The Thanksgiving Turkey Dinner With Friends! (October 12th) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Come celebrate Thanksgiving with friends over a wonderful turkey dinner in
  a warm and relaxed pub atmosphere!\nWhether you’re coming on your own o
 r with someone you know\, this is a chance to share some laughs\, enjoy a 
 great meal and spend Thanksgiving with a friendly group of people.\n\n\\*P
 lease note that we are at The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub at 1999 Avenue Road (
 roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence and south of the 401). We are in the ba
 ck dining area—come find us!\n\n\\*Please arrive between 6 pm and 7 pm i
 f you can :)\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\nEvent details below
 :\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n──────
 ────────\nEVENT DETAILS\n\nThe Thanksgiving Turkey Dinner 
 with Friends!\n(Monday\, October 12th)\n\nWe’ll settle in for an easygoi
 ng evening of good food\, conversation and Thanksgiving cheer.\n• A deli
 cious Thanksgiving turkey dinner\n• Drinks\, conversation and plenty of 
 laughs\n• A fun gratitude icebreaker game to get everyone talking\n• M
 eet new people and reconnect with familiar faces\n• Singles\, couples an
 d newcomers are all welcome\n• A relaxed and friendly atmosphere\nCome h
 ungry\, bring your Thanksgiving spirit\, and let’s make it a memorable e
 vening with friends!\n──────────────\nFRIENDLY
  REMINDERS\nEvent fee: $5 per person for reserved seating and event organi
 zation.\nFood and drinks are purchased separately.\nPay the event fee in c
 ash at the event or by e-transfer in advance to:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.c
 om](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\n\\*Great dinner menu and food speci
 als provided\n\\*One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support
  the venue\n──────────────\nPARKING AND TRANSP
 ORTATION\n\\*Lots of street parking on Avenue Road and free residential pa
 rking\nThe Pheasant: A Firkin Pub:\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasan
 tandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n\\*15–20
  minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station—or simply take the bus
  or an Uber from the station.
