SUMMARY:The Thanksgiving Cocktails and Desserts with Friends! (October 12t
 h) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Come celebrate Thanksgiving with friends over cocktails\, delicious desser
 ts and some great conversation in a warm and relaxed pub atmosphere!\n\nWh
 ether you’ve already enjoyed your Thanksgiving dinner\, are looking for 
 somewhere fun to go afterward\, or simply feel like joining us for drinks 
 and something sweet\, this is a chance to get together\, share some laughs
  and enjoy Thanksgiving evening with a friendly group of people.\n\n\\*Ple
 ase note that we are at The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub at 1999 Avenue Road (ro
 ughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence and south of the 401). We are in the back
  dining area—come find us!\n\nPlease arrive between between 7:15 pm and 
 8:15 pm if you can :)\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\nEvent deta
 ils below:\n\nSincerely\,\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n────
 ──────────\nEVENT DETAILS\n**The Thanksgiving Cocktail
 s and Desserts with Friends!**\n\nCome join us for a relaxed Thanksgiving 
 evening centred around cocktails\, drinks\, desserts and good company.\n\n
 • Enjoy a cocktail\, beer\, wine\, pop or your favourite drink\n• Trea
